LUDO AI – PRIVACY POLICY

Effective Date: November 8, 2026
Last Updated: November 8, 2026

1. Introduction

Welcome to Ludo AI, developed and published by Neosoft Studio.

Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, protect and share information when you use the Ludo AI mobile application.

By downloading or using Ludo AI, you acknowledge that you have read and understood this Privacy Policy.

If you do not agree with this policy, please discontinue using the application.

2. Information We Collect

Depending on how you use Ludo AI and which features are enabled, we may collect or process the following categories of information:

A. Account and Player Information

Ludo AI may use Firebase Authentication, including anonymous authentication, to create and manage player identities.

This may involve:

- Anonymous user IDs or account identifiers.
- Player names or nicknames, where provided.
- Player avatars and selected profile customisations.
- Game statistics, scores, achievements and gameplay records.
- Multiplayer information needed to identify players during online games.

We do not require you to provide your real name or personal contact information simply to play the game.

B. Gameplay Information

We may collect and store information associated with gameplay, including:

- Game results and player rankings.
- Wins, losses and other performance statistics.
- Tournament and multiplayer participation.
- AI difficulty selections and game settings.
- Virtual coin balances and transaction records.
- Progress, achievements and other game-related information.

This information helps us operate game features, maintain player progress and improve the gaming experience.

C. Device and Technical Information

Certain technical information may be collected automatically by the application or third-party services, including:

- Device model and manufacturer.
- Android operating system version.
- Application version.
- Device or installation identifiers.
- IP address or general network information, where processed by service providers.
- Crash reports, error logs and diagnostic information.

This information helps us troubleshoot technical problems, improve stability and protect the application.

D. Advertising Information

Ludo AI may display advertisements provided by Google AdMob.

Advertising services may process information such as:

- Advertising identifiers.
- Device and application information.
- Ad interaction and performance information.
- General location information inferred by the advertising provider, where applicable.

This information may be used to deliver, measure and improve advertisements, subject to applicable privacy settings and consent requirements.

E. Purchase Information

Ludo AI offers optional in-app purchases, which may include virtual coins, premium features and ad-removal options.

Purchases are processed through Google Play Billing.

We may receive information about purchases, such as:

- Product or purchase identifiers.
- Purchase status.
- Transaction verification information.
- Purchase history necessary to restore or manage purchased items.

We do not receive or store your complete credit card or bank account details through the application. Payment processing is handled by Google Play.

3. How We Use Your Information

We may use collected information for the following purposes:

- To provide and operate Ludo AI.
- To create and manage player identities.
- To support online multiplayer games and tournaments.
- To save game progress, statistics and achievements.
- To maintain virtual coin balances and purchased features.
- To verify and restore eligible purchases.
- To display and manage advertisements.
- To detect errors, crashes and technical problems.
- To prevent cheating, fraud and abuse.
- To improve game performance, functionality and user experience.
- To comply with applicable legal obligations.

We do not sell your personal information to third parties.

4. AI Gameplay

Ludo AI includes computer-controlled opponents with different difficulty levels.

The AI gameplay feature processes game states, moves and other gameplay information to determine its actions.

Where AI calculations take place locally on your device, the relevant game information is processed on your device. We do not use your personal information to train external AI models through ordinary gameplay.

5. Online Multiplayer

Ludo AI provides online multiplayer functionality that allows players to participate in games with other users.

To support these features, certain game-related information may be transmitted to our servers or service providers, including:

- Player identifiers.
- Player names or nicknames.
- Game room and session information.
- Game moves and turn information.
- Scores and match results.
- Information required to maintain multiplayer sessions.

Ludo AI does not provide chat, private messaging or text messaging between players.

Other players may see game-related information, such as your displayed player name, avatar and gameplay results, when participating in multiplayer features.

6. Virtual Coins and In-App Purchases

Ludo AI may offer virtual coins and other digital items.

Virtual coins are digital game items and do not represent real money, cash or a financial account.

Purchase transactions are processed through Google Play. We may use purchase records and transaction identifiers to verify purchases, prevent fraud and deliver purchased content.

We do not store your complete payment card or banking information.

7. Advertising and Third-Party Advertising Services

Ludo AI may use Google AdMob to display advertisements.

Google and its advertising partners may collect or process certain device, advertising and usage information to provide and measure advertisements.

Advertising practices may depend on your location, applicable laws, consent choices and device settings.

For more information about Google's privacy practices, please visit:

https://policies.google.com/privacy

You can also review Google's advertising settings through your Google account and supported Android device settings.

8. Third-Party Services

Ludo AI may use third-party services to provide certain application features.

These services may include:

- Firebase Authentication: For player authentication and account identification.
- Firebase services: For online game functionality and related data storage, where enabled.
- Google AdMob: For advertising services.
- Google Play Billing: For processing in-app purchases.
- Google Play Services: For supported Android gaming and application functionality.

These third-party providers may process information according to their own privacy policies and service terms.

We encourage you to review their privacy policies.

Firebase privacy information:

https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy

Google Privacy Policy:

https://policies.google.com/privacy

9. Data Sharing

We do not sell, rent or trade your personal information.

However, information may be shared with or processed by third-party service providers when necessary to:

- Operate multiplayer and online game features.
- Provide authentication and data storage.
- Display and measure advertisements.
- Process and verify purchases.
- Diagnose application errors.
- Protect the application against fraud and abuse.
- Comply with applicable laws or lawful requests.

We only intend to share information for legitimate purposes related to providing and maintaining the application.

10. Data Storage and Security

We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect information processed through Ludo AI.

Depending on the feature, information may be stored:

- Locally on your device.
- On Firebase or other service-provider infrastructure.
- Within Google Play's purchase systems.

We use appropriate safeguards intended to prevent unauthorised access, alteration, disclosure or destruction of information.

However, no electronic storage system or internet transmission can be guaranteed to be completely secure.

11. Data Retention and Deletion

We retain information only for as long as reasonably necessary to provide the application, maintain game functionality, fulfil purchases, prevent abuse and meet legal obligations.

Some gameplay information may remain stored locally on your device until you clear the application data or uninstall the application.

For information associated with an online player identity, you may contact us to request account and associated data deletion.

To submit a request, email:

studioneosoft@gmail.com

Please include sufficient information for us to identify the relevant account. Do not send passwords or payment card details.

We will review and process valid deletion requests, subject to applicable legal requirements and legitimate retention obligations.

Some transaction records may need to be retained where required for accounting, fraud prevention or legal compliance.

12. Children's Privacy

Ludo AI is intended for users aged 16 years and above.

We do not knowingly design the application to collect personal information from children below this age.

If we become aware that personal information has been collected from a child in a manner that violates applicable law, we will take appropriate steps to address the situation.

Parents or guardians who believe that a child has provided personal information to us may contact us at:

studioneosoft@gmail.com

13. Permissions and Device Access

Ludo AI does not require access to your contacts, camera, microphone or personal files for its ordinary gameplay features.

The application may use internet connectivity to support online multiplayer, advertisements, purchase verification and other online services.

If future versions introduce features requiring additional permissions, those permissions will be requested when necessary and handled according to applicable platform requirements.

14. International Data Processing

Some third-party service providers may process or store information on servers located outside your country of residence.

Where this occurs, information may be subject to the laws and data protection requirements of the countries in which it is processed.

We take reasonable steps to use service providers that maintain appropriate data protection and security measures.

15. Your Privacy Rights

Depending on your location and applicable laws, you may have rights to:

- Request access to certain personal information.
- Request correction of inaccurate information.
- Request deletion of eligible personal information.
- Object to or restrict certain processing activities.
- Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent.

To exercise applicable rights or ask questions about your information, contact us using the details provided below.

16. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in the application, our services, legal requirements or data handling practices.

When changes are made, we will update the Last Updated date at the beginning of this document.

We encourage users to review this page periodically.

Continued use of Ludo AI after an updated policy becomes effective will be subject to the updated policy, to the extent permitted by applicable law.

